1
00:00:00,263 --> 00:00:02,463
(Stuart:)Must be nice.

2
00:00:02,632 --> 00:00:04,862
(Stuart:)Nobody wants anything
that comes out of me.

3
00:00:11,074 --> 00:00:15,634
- I wonder what he's doing this very second.
- Conducting experiments in zero gravity.

4
00:00:15,812 --> 00:00:18,442
(Raj:)Peering through his telescope
at the birth of the cosmos.

5
00:00:18,614 --> 00:00:21,484
(Sheldon:)Whatever it is,
we know his life will never be the same.

6
00:00:21,951 --> 00:00:25,511
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Howard, can you hear me?

7
00:00:25,888 --> 00:00:28,688
I can hear you without the phone!

8
00:00:29,659 --> 00:00:33,619
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Don't be snippy.
I'm just excited to talk to my baby.

9
00:00:33,796 --> 00:00:36,126
(Howard:)I'm excited to talk to you too.

10
00:00:36,299 --> 00:00:41,469
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)So, what's this mishegas about you
moving out to go live with the little Polish girl?

11
00:00:42,205 --> 00:00:44,935
How about calling her my wife? Heh.

12
00:00:45,174 --> 00:00:47,504
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Wives don't take boys from their mothers.

13
00:00:47,677 --> 00:00:50,267
(Howard:)They do, that's why we marry them.

14
00:00:52,448 --> 00:00:56,278
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)I just hope I'm not dead
from a broken heart before you get back.

15
00:00:56,619 --> 00:01:00,949
(Howard:)Ma, please, everyone from NASA
is listening to this phone call.

16
00:01:01,124 --> 00:01:04,724
(Mrs Wolowitz(off):)Good, they should know
what a horrible son you are.

17
00:01:04,927 --> 00:01:08,127
(Howard:)Okay, Ma, great talking to you.
Gotta go.

18
00:01:09,999 --> 00:01:11,159
(Howard:)Well...

19
00:01:11,367 --> 00:01:17,027
(Howard:)...space is ruined.

